        "texte": "I had been having difficulty taking a decent photo myself, so I downloaded this app. I hadn't realized it would use the first photo I took, and I personally did not think my photo was any good. However, what I received back from them was super because the background was white, whereas mine had been yellow, and a light switch had been removed. The photo was accepted by the UK online passport renewal system, and the passport is on its way to us. Well worth the almost €6 I paid. Great app!",
